supportingObject (
    prerequisites {
        systemPrivileges: [
            createTable
            createView
            createProcedure
            createTrigger
            createSequence
        ]
    }
    installationMessages {
        welcome:
            ```
            Installs the shared XXFND_ database objects (security, flexfields, attachments, workflow), the common seed data and the first administrator into the parsing schema (XXFUS).
            ```
        confirmation:
            ```
            Install the database objects now? Existing XXFND_ tables are upgraded instead of recreated.
            ```
        installSuccess:
            ```
            Installed. You are the first Common Administrator.
            ```
        installFailure:
            ```
            Installation failed. Check the script results, fix the cause and reinstall Supporting Objects; every script can be re-run.
            ```
    }
    upgrade {
        upgradeWhenSqlQuery:
            ```sql
            select null from user_tables where table_name = 'XXFND_LOOKUP_TYPES'
            ```
    }
    upgradeMessages {
        welcome:
            ```
            Upgrades the shared packages, views and seed data. Tables and data are kept.
            ```
        success:
            ```
            Upgrade complete.
            ```
    }
)
